    narr:narration """The discourse surrounding [decision capture](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) has evolved from a March 2026 conceptual mandate into a series of concrete, operational milestones. The narrative now centers on the successful deployment of the [async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787564412032_1), which serves as the primary artifact for the core thesis. This implementation is explicitly linked to a [peak in team velocity](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787564412032_2), with the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787564412032_3) cited as the technical catalyst for this output. While the initial framing emphasized the conceptual necessity of capturing consensus, the current trajectory is defined by empirical validation and the quantification of efficiency gains following the integration of these features into the existing technical stack.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787564412032_1> ;
